<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Learner paper · 繁體</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Learner paper · 繁體</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 20 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. What will the woman do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去車站接人</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 整理客房</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 去買水果</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. When will the family begin dinner?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晚上六點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上七點</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上六點四十</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. How often does the speaker have this meal at Grandma’s home?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每月兩次</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 每週兩次</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 每天一次</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. Where can the woman ride on a flat route during her free time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 山邊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 河邊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 學校裏面</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which approach does Xiaolin’s experience support choosing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 每次都爭取騎得最快</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 輕鬆騎車，不只比速度</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 騎車時一直不許停</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. Where will the man wait?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 老菜市場門口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 郵局裏面</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 新市場東門</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. How will they travel to the market?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 坐公交車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 騎自行車</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走路</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. What should the man do first after leaving the station?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 立即過橋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 直接走向南門</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 沿河向北走</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which service meets the man’s arrival and payment needs?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 市場班車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩種車都一定不能坐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 公交車</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. What will they do this Sunday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 照常去外面放風箏</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先在家做紙風箏</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把活動全部取消不再做</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. How many boxes of biscuits will be given as gifts?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 兩盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三盒</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Which cup matches the uncle’s stated preference?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 帶把手的小杯子</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 帶把手的大杯子</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 沒有把手的小杯子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. What is the stated price of the packaged gift set?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 二十五塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十八塊</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 六塊</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. Which gift meets the journey-related requirements?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 圍巾</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 玻璃杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大花瓶</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. What will the woman prepare before the guests arrive?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 重新訂晚飯</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 把客廳椅子擺好</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 等男生到家再準備座位</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What change is forecast for the afternoon?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 風會完全停下來</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 會比早上熱很多</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 風會明顯變大</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. Why are they writing the cards indoors?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 外面正在下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 屋外的活動要到晚上纔開始</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 外面的風會吹走紙</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. Which plan fits the water availability during this outing?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 到廣場再裝水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 到路上商店再買水</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 出門前在家裝水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What did the family do immediately after dinner?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一起分月餅</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先給姐姐打電話</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 馬上去陽臺拍照</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. How does Grandma appear to feel after the video call starts?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c2c-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 很高興能和哥哥聯繫</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 完全不想看哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 生氣得不肯喫飯</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 25 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What does the mother ask Xiaozhou to do first?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">給小周的留言<br>客人上午就到，玄關的鞋子已經收好了，水果也洗過了。請你回家後先把餐桌上的課本放進書櫃，給客人留出喝茶的地方。不要把書放到陽臺，那裏下午風大。<br>媽媽</p></div><p class="note">玄關: entrance area</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 把課本放進書櫃</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 再洗一次水果</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 把課本搬到陽臺</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. When does the formal video conversation begin?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭視頻安排<br>今晚七點先喫飯，七點半檢查手機和網絡，八點正式和外地舅舅視頻聊天。八點半再給他看客人帶來的照片。請不要把設備檢查時間當作正式聊天的開始時間。</p></div><p class="note">設備: equipment</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 晚上七點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 晚上八點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 晚上八點</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. How long does Xiao’an spend tidying each evening under the current arrangement?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小安的家務記錄<br>客人住在我家這幾天，我每天晚飯後整理客廳十五分鐘。以前媽媽建議我整理半小時，現在家人分工以後，我只要十五分鐘就能完成。客人走後會再討論新的分工，不用每天做同樣的事。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十五分鐘</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 半小時</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一小時</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Which riding period fits Xiaolin’s arrival and both opening windows?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">週日騎行信息<br>公園騎行區上午十點到十一點開放；門口租車處九點半到十點半營業，車可以在十一點歸還。小林九點五十分到公園，想當天先租車再進騎行區，上午十一點必須離開。</p></div><p class="note">租: rent</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九點半到十點</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 十點到十點半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 十一點到十一點半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. What does Xiaolin’s choice suggest mattered most on this outing?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的騎行記錄<br>妹妹剛學會騎車，跟不上原來那組快車隊。我今天沒有跟車隊出發，而是陪妹妹慢慢騎，到她想休息的時候就一起停下。朋友問我騎了多遠，我先給他看了和妹妹的合影。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 陪家人一起騎車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一定要比朋友騎得遠</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 完全不願意停下來</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Where should shoppers go for this week’s market?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">社區市場通知<br>原來在舊車庫裏的週末市場暫停一週。本週的攤位搬到社區活動室旁邊的小院，入口在郵局對面。不要再到舊車庫排隊，那裏本週只接收工作人員的物資。</p></div><p class="note">攤位: market stall</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 舊車庫裏面</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 郵局營業廳裏面</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 社區活動室旁的小院</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. Which transport does the host ask the guest to use from North Station?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">給來訪客人的交通說明<br>請從北站坐地鐵二號線，到市場站下車。我們會在車站出口接你，行李多也不用走遠路。不要買去南站的長途汽車票，南站離我們家很遠。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去南站的長途汽車</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 自己騎車過來</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 地鐵二號線</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. What is the first step after leaving the station?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">市場繞行說明<br>南門前正在修路。從車站出來，請先走地下通道到街對面，再順着河邊走到小橋。過橋後就是臨時市場的北入口。不要在地下通道出口直接向南，那邊圍起來不能通行。</p></div><p class="note">地下通道: underpass</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 馬上向南走</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 先過河上的小橋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 走地下通道到街對面</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Which route meets the collection-point and cycling requirements?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">市場取貨路線<br>甲路線穿過步行街，不準騎車，只能下車推着走，終點是東門。乙路線沿外圈車道直達南門，可以一路騎行。小周的貨在南門，他希望不用下車推車就到取貨處。</p></div><p class="note">步行街: pedestrian street</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲路線</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 兩條都直接到南門</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 乙路線</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. How will participants now join the seven-o’clock event?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">中秋社區活動更新<br>大風影響了戶外佈置，原定晚上七點在廣場聽故事，改爲同一時間的視頻故事會。大家在家參加，活動鏈接下午發到報名羣，不用到廣場，也不用去活動室佔座。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 到廣場聽故事</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 在家參加視頻故事會</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 先去活動室佔座</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. How many greeting cards are on the order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">禮品取貨單<br>茶葉兩份，賀卡六張，鮮花三束。六位客人每人收到一張賀卡；茶葉和鮮花另按家庭分。請按單取貨，不要因爲有三束花就只帶三張卡，卡片上的名字已經寫好了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三張</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六張</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 兩張</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which gift matches Grandma’s stated wish?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">給奶奶選禮物<br>奶奶說自己不缺茶葉，也不想要只有圖片的畫冊。她最想要一本字比較大、能跟着唱的歌曲書。小週記下了這個願望，準備在親戚來訪前去書店找。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 只有圖片的畫冊</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 茶葉禮盒</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大字歌曲書</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. Which delivery charge applies to Xiaozhou’s order?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">花店送貨單<br>鮮花四十五元。送到學校門口加五元，送到家加八元。小周讓店員送到學校，自己放學後帶回家，所以這張單總共五十元。不要按送到家的運費付款。</p></div><p class="note">運費: delivery charge</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八元</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 五十元</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 五元</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. Which shop meets both the booking situation and collection deadline?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">便餐選擇<br>今天臨時決定請客，沒有提前預訂，飯菜必須六點半前取到。甲店六點可取，但必須前一天訂。乙店今天訂，六點二十可取。丙店不用預訂，但最早七點取。三家都有現做的便餐。</p></div><p class="note">預訂: book in advance</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲店</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙店</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙店</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. What will Xiaolin prepare for the visitor’s revised plan?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">家庭消息<br>叔叔的車票從明天改到今晚，來不及留下喫晚飯。小林下午在家，媽媽請他把飯菜裝進飯盒，六點交給叔叔帶走。客房不用鋪牀了，叔叔今天不住下。小林答應先準備飯盒。</p></div><p class="note">客房: guest room</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 先給客房鋪牀</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 裝好可以帶走的飯菜</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 等待明天再準備飯菜</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. According to the latest forecast shown, what is expected this afternoon?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">預報更新<br>昨晚的消息說今天下午有大風。今早九點的新預報改爲下午風弱，不下雨。負責人提醒小組以九點發布的預報爲準，後續若再有變化會另發通知，先不要轉發昨晚的舊消息。</p></div><p class="note">轉發: forward a message</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 風弱，不下雨</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 仍有昨晚說的大風</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一定會下大雨</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. Why is the group not proceeding with today’s ride?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">騎行小組通知<br>今天的河邊騎行取消，原因是預報有大風，負責人決定不按原計劃組織。報名人數足夠，老師也有空，自行車檢查正常。請大家等新的日期通知，不要自己按舊時間到河邊集合。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 預報有大風</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 報名的人太少</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 自行車沒有檢查好</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which option meets both requirements on the card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">騎行物品卡<br>本次要求帶普通白水，裝在能蓋緊的瓶子裏。甲瓶裝白水，有能擰緊的蓋。乙杯也是白水，但沒有蓋。丙瓶有蓋，裏面卻是果汁。小周要按物品卡選一份帶走。</p></div><p class="note">擰緊: screw tight</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 甲瓶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 乙杯</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 丙瓶</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What follows attaching the family photo to the card?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">中秋家庭賀卡步驟<br>先把全家合影貼在卡片中間，再請每位家人寫一句話。大家都寫好以後，把卡放進信封，第二天寄給遠方的叔叔。沒有寫齊以前不要封口，免得漏掉誰的祝福。</p></div><p class="note">信封: envelope</p><p class="note">祝福: good wishes</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 馬上封好信封</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 請每位家人寫一句話</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 當天直接寄出</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What does Xiaolin’s behaviour suggest about the gathering?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林的中秋記錄<br>今年親戚從外地趕來，我買菜做飯忙了一個下午，確實很累。喫飯時看到大家終於坐在同一張桌旁，我忍不住笑了。晚上把合影存好，第二天又拿出來看，還發給了沒能來的姐姐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 他很珍惜這次團聚</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 他完全不願意留下照片</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 他只記得自己累，沒有開心過</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 20 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 20 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to changed shopping and dinner plans</h2><p>Reply to Xiaozhou in Chinese. Say whether you can collect the gift from the flower shop after six and whether dinner should be at home or at a restaurant near the market. Give a reason for your plan. Suggest another workable arrangement or ask one relevant question. You may invent details. About 40-60 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小林：客人改到六點到站，還帶着行李。我去接站，花店的禮物六點以後才能取。你能幫忙取嗎？晚飯在家喫還是在市場旁的餐館喫？我們重新安排一下吧。<br>小周</p></div><ul><li>Say whether you can collect the gift after six.</li><li>Choose dinner at home or a restaurant, or explain a feasible alternative.</li><li>Give a reason related to the plan.</li><li>Suggest an alternative arrangement or ask a relevant question.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Describe a family festival gathering</h2><p>Use the fictional card to describe last year’s family Mid-Autumn gathering. Include when and where, at least two actions in a consistent sequence, and a feeling or reason. Connected simple Chinese sentences are enough. About 80-120 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">時間：去年中秋晚上<br>地點：家裏<br>飯前：全家一起擺桌子<br>晚飯時：接通視頻，和外地姐姐聊天<br>飯後：分月餅、看全家照片<br>結束前：給姐姐拍一段祝福視頻<br>感受：自己選擇並說明</p></div><ul><li>Identify last year’s Mid-Autumn evening.</li><li>Identify the family home.</li><li>Describe one action on the card.</li><li>Describe a second action in a consistent sequence.</li><li>Give a feeling or reason.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Plan purchases before visitors arrive</h2><p>A family member is planning shopping before guests arrive. Answer four fixed recorded prompts in Chinese. Each prompt plays twice, then allow 15 seconds to prepare and up to 25 seconds to record. Use real or invented details. All four responses form one task out of eight; the prompts do not adapt to your answer.</p><p>State a shopping need, choose something for the guests, explain the choice, and handle an earlier market closing time.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 15 seconds to prepare and 25 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Compare two community activities</h2><p>Recommend one activity to a classmate who is free only on Sunday morning, wants to make a greeting card for a visiting grandparent and has no craft materials at home. Compare the options, state a choice, give two reasons using the cards and describe a short plan. If your choice changes the original goal, explain that change. Prepare for 60 seconds and speak for up to 90 seconds.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">社區週日活動<br>甲：手工教室賀卡課，上午九點到十點，二十元含全部材料；老師可以幫助寫字，做好的卡可以帶回家。<br>乙：閱覽室故事會，上午九點到十點，免費；可以借一本故事書回家，沒有手工材料，也不安排製作賀卡。<br>同學：只有上午有空，想親手做賀卡送給來訪的外婆，家中沒有材料，兩項活動的費用都能接受。</p></div><ul><li>Compare one or more features of both activities.</li><li>Choose an activity.</li><li>Give a first reason supported by the cards.</li><li>Give a second distinct reason supported by the cards.</li><li>Describe a feasible plan and explain any change to the original goal.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>